    "description": "API of the Trip-Weave Next.js app (routes under app/api/).\n\nStart the app with `npm run dev`, run **Sign up** once, then **Log in**: it sets the session cookie that the protected requests need, which Postman keeps and sends by itself. Change `base_url` to test a deployed copy.",
